# Draft delivery lineage exported by the Proposal Workbench (BRSF software-development profile). Refine, then validate with the BRSF validator.

ex:Mission a backlog:Mission ; rdfs:label "Consistency checker for ambulance maintenance and mileage records"@en ; backlog:hasMissionStatement "Give the Maintenance clerk and the Fleet supervisor of the vehicle maintenance unit a tool that reads the Portal's vehicle export, checks every maintenance, fault and mileage record against a written set of consistency rules, lists each violation with the rule it breaks, and warns which vehicles are approaching their periodic maintenance, so that record errors are found the week they are made rather than when a maintenance is missed, and nobody has to read the database by hand." ; backlog:hasMissionOutcome "A maintenance clerk uploads the weekly export and within a minute sees which records contradict each other and why; the fleet supervisor opens the panel and sees which ambulances are due for periodic maintenance in the next two weeks, without asking a developer to query the database." ; backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_OwnerStated .
ex:Lineage a backlog:Lineage ; backlog:lineageForMission ex:Mission ; backlog:adoptsObligationSet backlog:OS_SDLC_v2 .
ex:Customer1 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "İstanbul İl Ambulans Servisi Başhekimliği, Araç Bakım Onarım Birimi (Vehicle Maintenance and Repair Unit)"@en ; rdfs:comment "Customer (owner): an automatic check of the vehicle records its clerks enter into the Portal, a monthly violation report and an early warning for periodic maintenance, so corrections stop depending on one developer reading the database by hand"@en .
ex:EndUser1 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Maintenance clerk"@en ; rdfs:comment "End user: the clerks of the vehicle maintenance unit who enter maintenance, fault and mileage records for the ambulance fleet into the Portal - uploads the Portal export, reads the violation list and corrects the records it names in the Portal (weekly, office desktop, browser and Excel)"@en .
ex:EndUser2 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Fleet supervisor"@en ; rdfs:comment "End user: the supervisor of the vehicle maintenance unit who answers for the fleet's maintenance schedule - reads the monthly summary and the list of vehicles whose periodic maintenance is due (monthly, office desktop browser)"@en .
