ex:X1 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Writing corrections back into the Portal database"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "the Portal is a live system used by the whole service; the tool proposes corrections and a clerk applies them in the Portal" .
ex:X2 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Driver, patient and personnel data"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "the rules need only vehicle, mileage and date fields, and personal data would bring the KVKK duties into the project" .
